[h1]Auto-assign workers. One click.[/h1]
[b]Automatically assign residents to suitable buildings[/b] based on guild specialties and productivity, while keeping workers free for construction. Click whenever you want to rebalance; there is no continuous background reassignment.

[list]
[*][b]Smart staffing:[/b] minimum operating crews before extra workers, subject to eligibility and your reserve.
[*][b]Builder reserve:[/b] leave 0-100 residents unassigned. Default: 1.
[*][b]Your priorities:[/b] strict or weighted mode, categories and building-type overrides.
[*][b]Protected workplaces:[/b] paused and unsupported buildings keep their workers.
[/list]

[h2]Quick start[/h2]
Subscribe, let Steam download, then restart the game. Remove any separate local WorkerOptimizer installation first.
Click the [b]arrow at the lower left[/b] to optimize. [b]Ctrl + Alt + O[/b] toggles visibility; the gear changes the shortcut. Configure staffing under [b]Settings > Mods[/b]. Resume the simulation to process assignments. A second click cancels further changes, not completed assignments.

[b]Languages:[/b] EN, DE, PL, FR. Dutch is prepared but not selectable in the current game.
[b]Development build 0.1.1-dev:[/b] startup and adaptive UI repair for Windows / Whiskerwood 0.7.209.0. In-game validation of this update is pending. Use a test save; large cities and special roles need broader testing.

